WEBVTT

01:38.070 --> 01:43.050
[Shadow Punisher]

01:43.110 --> 01:43.690
[Divine Constable Tally]

01:43.690 --> 01:45.940
[Episode 11]

01:53.200 --> 01:54.710
[Ferry]

01:55.840 --> 01:56.700
Excuse me, sir.

01:57.789 --> 01:58.680
Are there any ships heading to

01:58.680 --> 02:00.280
Mingling County, Qingzhou?

02:00.590 --> 02:01.590
Heading south?

02:01.870 --> 02:03.310
See the ship with the "Gong" flag?

02:03.310 --> 02:04.510
It came from Qingzhou.

02:04.510 --> 02:05.430
Go ask them.

02:05.590 --> 02:06.400
Thank you.

02:09.080 --> 02:10.120
There's a ship?

02:13.870 --> 02:14.840
Be careful.

02:16.000 --> 02:16.800
Freeze.

02:17.590 --> 02:18.520
Zhenzhu?

02:20.590 --> 02:21.400
Meng Rui?

02:21.710 --> 02:23.120
What brings you here?

02:23.310 --> 02:25.079
Yan, what a coincidence.

02:25.180 --> 02:26.280
Aren't you on leave?

02:26.280 --> 02:27.210
Why are you here?

02:28.520 --> 02:30.120
I am on leave.

02:30.190 --> 02:31.280
I'm just about to take a ship

02:31.280 --> 02:32.630
to travel south.

02:32.840 --> 02:34.130
South?

02:34.710 --> 02:35.970
Is it Mingling County?

02:37.870 --> 02:38.680
Come on.

02:39.079 --> 02:40.680
We all know what's going on.

02:40.710 --> 02:41.870
How could I not know

02:41.910 --> 02:43.120
what is on your mind?

02:43.520 --> 02:45.060
You Little Ice Cube.

02:45.190 --> 02:46.870
You can fool the Chief,

02:46.910 --> 02:48.470
but you can't fool me.

02:48.910 --> 02:51.310
Resting and feeling homesick?

02:51.310 --> 02:52.520
No one would believe these words

02:52.520 --> 02:53.280
coming from

02:53.280 --> 02:54.400
a Constable Ghost's mouth.

02:54.400 --> 02:55.329
Right, Zhenzhu?

02:57.079 --> 02:58.310
I figure

02:58.310 --> 02:59.400
Mingling County

02:59.420 --> 03:01.270
must have a

03:01.590 --> 03:02.910
huge case.

03:03.680 --> 03:05.410
You want to go there without me?

03:06.680 --> 03:07.590
No way!

03:07.800 --> 03:08.910
This is what it means

03:08.910 --> 03:10.910
to face dangers together—

03:10.960 --> 03:12.560
And solve cases together.

03:13.280 --> 03:15.310
Let's go. I've asked about the ship.

03:16.610 --> 03:18.000
[Ferry]

03:16.710 --> 03:18.570
This trip is of great importance.

03:18.630 --> 03:19.630
Tell the brothers

03:19.680 --> 03:21.030
to stay alert.

03:21.630 --> 03:23.560
Excuse me, is there a boatman here?

03:25.190 --> 03:26.190
Are you the owner?

03:26.370 --> 03:27.540
Officer,

03:27.680 --> 03:29.310
you can't just say that.

03:29.310 --> 03:30.240
Who doesn't know

03:30.550 --> 03:31.829
that on the sea,

03:31.850 --> 03:33.150
all the Gong family's ships

03:33.150 --> 03:34.900
belong to Old Madam Gong?

03:34.930 --> 03:36.980
I am Shama Reda.

03:37.370 --> 03:38.760
I am just a manager

03:38.790 --> 03:40.310
in charge of chores.

03:40.680 --> 03:41.610
The Gong family?

03:41.910 --> 03:44.120
The Gong family of Mingling County,
Qingzhou?

03:44.120 --> 03:45.079
On the sea,

03:45.630 --> 03:47.290
there is only one Gong family.

03:48.310 --> 03:49.870
What a boast.

03:50.840 --> 03:52.280
He's not wrong.

03:52.430 --> 03:53.890
Among civilian shipping,

03:54.030 --> 03:56.240
the Gong family
was appointed by His Majesty

03:56.240 --> 03:57.750
for official transport.

03:58.590 --> 03:59.910
No matter whose ship this is,

03:59.910 --> 04:00.710
are you

04:00.710 --> 04:02.800
going to Mingling County, Qingzhou?

04:02.870 --> 04:04.000
We are about to go back there.

04:04.000 --> 04:04.800
Great.

04:05.120 --> 04:05.870
Let's go.

04:05.820 --> 04:07.200
[Ferry]

04:06.870 --> 04:07.680
Officer,

04:07.810 --> 04:08.940
I'm terribly sorry.

04:09.310 --> 04:11.240
This ship doesn't take outsiders.

04:11.680 --> 04:13.710
You should find another ship.

04:13.710 --> 04:14.630
Why?

04:15.120 --> 04:16.880
It's not like we won't pay you.

04:16.930 --> 04:18.779
Who wouldn't want money?

04:19.040 --> 04:20.310
But this ship

04:20.310 --> 04:21.430
has already been chartered

04:21.430 --> 04:22.390
by another official.

04:22.390 --> 04:23.190
Official?

04:30.040 --> 04:30.970
Qingyang?

04:31.430 --> 04:32.700
As the saying goes,

04:33.040 --> 04:34.870
"Meet a kindred soul aboard a boat,

04:34.870 --> 04:36.600
and entrust your life
to the boundless sea."

04:36.600 --> 04:38.800
A God of Wealth insists on following us,

04:39.430 --> 04:40.800
which is exactly what we want.

04:40.800 --> 04:42.130
What are we waiting for?

04:42.430 --> 04:43.480
Get on board.

04:43.340 --> 04:46.000
♪ I open the door to winds of change ♪

04:43.870 --> 04:44.680
Let's go.

04:46.070 --> 04:47.270
You brat.

04:47.340 --> 04:50.080
♪ With no desire to gaze at the stars ♪

04:51.380 --> 04:54.070
♪ Dreams may soothe the pain ♪

04:55.220 --> 04:58.150
♪ But they're too easily disturbed ♪

04:58.659 --> 05:00.790
♪ So I'll stand up high on a tower ♪

05:01.290 --> 05:03.130
♪ Never looking away ♪

05:03.620 --> 05:05.170
♪ And see how so-called fate ♪

05:05.240 --> 05:06.270
Great.

05:05.680 --> 05:07.350
♪ Makes choices for me ♪

05:06.870 --> 05:07.600
The reward

05:07.600 --> 05:09.160
will have to be divided
into one more share.

05:07.640 --> 05:09.380
♪ Let the breathtaking ♪

05:09.190 --> 05:10.000
Sanhuo.

05:09.820 --> 05:11.310
♪ Take the place of cold, lonely stars ♪

05:10.430 --> 05:11.270
Don't worry.

05:11.690 --> 05:13.230
♪ Cutting through the mist ♪

05:11.720 --> 05:12.600
This time,

05:12.680 --> 05:14.120
I sneaked out.

05:13.520 --> 05:15.860
♪ To light up my eyes ♪

05:14.120 --> 05:15.310
I'll be lucky enough if the Chief

05:15.310 --> 05:16.310
doesn't punish me when I get back.

05:16.030 --> 05:18.660
♪ If the moonlight is hidden
and the candles burn out ♪

05:16.510 --> 05:17.310
How could I

05:17.830 --> 05:19.430
take a share of the reward?

05:19.330 --> 05:21.030
♪ And I can't see myself ♪

05:24.100 --> 05:26.710
♪ I believe
some unseen longing surges within ♪

05:27.260 --> 05:29.070
♪ Pulling me along ♪

05:29.360 --> 05:30.160
Come on.

05:30.950 --> 05:31.680
Why do you guys

05:31.680 --> 05:33.120
look so lifeless?

05:33.310 --> 05:35.310
This is the first time
our Four Divine Constables

05:35.310 --> 05:36.600
have gathered together

05:36.600 --> 05:37.930
for official business.

05:38.120 --> 05:39.190
Don't you think

05:39.870 --> 05:41.530
even the scenery along the way

05:41.630 --> 05:42.560
has become more

05:42.560 --> 05:43.680
charming?

05:45.200 --> 05:47.650
♪ After all the twists and turns,
through a thousand joys and sorrows ♪

05:48.159 --> 05:51.820
♪ I only hope tomorrow finds me
still full of courage ♪

05:53.000 --> 05:54.659
♪ At daybreak, I'll look back ♪

05:55.420 --> 05:59.970
♪ And finally understand
why this journey had to be mine ♪

06:17.140 --> 06:24.620
[Mingling Serial Corpse Case]

06:35.120 --> 06:35.920
Look there.

06:36.720 --> 06:37.580
There are fish.

06:42.680 --> 06:44.610
Come and look! We're almost there!

06:44.690 --> 06:51.870
[Mingling County, Coastal Qingzhou,
Great Shi, Early Summer]

06:52.340 --> 06:54.710
[Mingling County]

06:52.920 --> 06:53.720
Hold it!

06:53.720 --> 06:54.360
Okay.

06:55.630 --> 06:56.240
Careful.

06:56.920 --> 06:57.720
Be quick!

06:57.720 --> 06:59.040
Hurry up and bring the ladder over!

06:59.040 --> 06:59.720
Hurry!

06:59.720 --> 07:00.430
Over there!

07:01.270 --> 07:02.600
The weather in the south

07:02.720 --> 07:03.920
is indeed different.

07:04.090 --> 07:05.240
It's just the beginning of summer,

07:05.240 --> 07:06.570
and it's already so hot.

07:08.920 --> 07:09.870
Mr. Reda,

07:11.040 --> 07:12.640
what are those people doing?

07:13.720 --> 07:15.680
They are rushing to dig a flood channel

07:15.680 --> 07:17.140
so that if it rains heavily later,

07:17.140 --> 07:18.950
the whole county won't be flooded.

07:18.950 --> 07:19.750
What?

07:19.870 --> 07:20.800
Heavy rain?

07:22.680 --> 07:23.810
Who are you kidding?

07:24.190 --> 07:25.430
It's so sunny.

07:25.430 --> 07:27.040
We're almost dried out.

07:27.190 --> 07:28.510
How could there be heavy rain?

07:28.510 --> 07:29.480
Well,

07:29.630 --> 07:30.940
you have no idea.

07:31.310 --> 07:32.630
Our Mingling County

07:32.870 --> 07:34.390
is backed by Mount Fuyao

07:34.510 --> 07:35.680
and faces the sea,

07:35.870 --> 07:37.870
with the Yan River
flowing through the mountains.

07:37.870 --> 07:40.430
The weather and terrain

07:40.510 --> 07:42.370
can be different every few miles.

07:42.390 --> 07:44.120
One moment it's sunny,

07:44.120 --> 07:46.430
and the next it's pouring rain.

07:47.000 --> 07:48.510
It's the rainy season now.

07:48.630 --> 07:49.510
It rains

07:49.510 --> 07:50.600
every few days.

07:51.920 --> 07:53.040
A little carelessness

07:53.040 --> 07:54.800
will cause floods

07:55.070 --> 07:56.310
and trigger a plague.

07:56.390 --> 07:57.190
So,

07:57.310 --> 07:58.570
we can't be negligent.

08:19.160 --> 08:20.390
Thank you. Thank you.

08:20.680 --> 08:21.210
Let's go.

08:23.070 --> 08:23.870
Careful.

08:25.000 --> 08:26.240
Come on, put some effort into it.

08:26.240 --> 08:27.070
Excuse me.

08:27.070 --> 08:27.430
Watch out.

08:27.430 --> 08:28.070
Be careful.

08:28.070 --> 08:29.310
Good job, everyone!

08:28.800 --> 08:31.350
[Situ Bo, Magistrate of Mingling County]

08:30.680 --> 08:32.030
Put some more effort into it!

08:32.030 --> 08:32.840
Okay!

08:32.860 --> 08:33.650
Okay!

08:34.909 --> 08:35.720
My Lord.

08:37.200 --> 08:39.260
People from Tianhuang City are here.

08:43.440 --> 08:45.900
I'm Situ Bo,
magistrate of Mingling County.

08:47.600 --> 08:49.320
Greetings, Divine Constables.

08:49.320 --> 08:51.030
You are Situ Bo?

08:51.480 --> 08:52.440
Yes, I am.

08:52.720 --> 08:53.510
Divine Constables,

08:53.510 --> 08:55.240
you arrived in Mingling County
so suddenly.

08:55.240 --> 08:57.080
I didn't have time to change into
my official uniform.

08:57.080 --> 08:58.030
Please forgive

08:58.030 --> 08:59.090
my lack of manners.

08:59.840 --> 09:02.200
May I ask what brings you here?

09:02.270 --> 09:03.080
Of course,

09:03.080 --> 09:04.870
it's for the case you reported.

09:05.120 --> 09:06.440
It says that

09:06.480 --> 09:07.600
a green-haired demon suddenly appeared

09:07.600 --> 09:08.870
in Mingling County.

09:09.000 --> 09:11.460
We're here
specifically to catch the demon.

09:12.030 --> 09:13.720
The story of the green-haired demon

09:13.720 --> 09:14.630
has been spreading by word of mouth

09:14.630 --> 09:15.720
among the locals.

09:15.720 --> 09:17.180
It's mostly exaggerated.

09:17.630 --> 09:19.320
But I was afraid it might hurt people,

09:19.320 --> 09:20.630
so I led my men in searching for it
many times,

09:20.630 --> 09:21.990
but we found no trace of it.

09:21.990 --> 09:23.870
Reporting it
to the Divine Constable Bureau

09:23.870 --> 09:25.240
was a last resort.

09:26.320 --> 09:27.120
My Lord!

09:27.510 --> 09:28.320
Bad news!

09:29.270 --> 09:30.000
Bad news, My Lord.

09:30.000 --> 09:30.910
A corpse was found

09:30.910 --> 09:32.430
in Yan River in Mount Fuyao.

09:32.430 --> 09:33.360
My Lord, please go and take a look.

09:33.360 --> 09:34.120
Lead the way.

09:34.270 --> 09:35.120
Okay.

09:40.120 --> 09:40.910
Let's go.

09:55.980 --> 09:57.480
Luckily, it was found

09:57.510 --> 09:58.110
before the heavy rain.

09:58.110 --> 09:59.030
Otherwise, it would have been

09:59.030 --> 10:00.120
washed into the sea by now.

10:00.120 --> 10:01.670
Mingling is really like you said.

10:01.670 --> 10:02.670
The rain comes fast

10:02.670 --> 10:03.510
and goes fast.

10:03.530 --> 10:05.260
The weather in Mingling is just like this.

10:05.260 --> 10:06.120
-Everyone here…
-Yan.

10:06.120 --> 10:08.180
has some ability to read the weather.

10:09.840 --> 10:11.360
It's been soaked like this.

10:11.360 --> 10:12.890
We can't even tell who it is.

10:27.440 --> 10:28.200
Where is Meng Rui?

10:28.200 --> 10:30.130
He went upstream to look for clues.

10:30.510 --> 10:31.840
If the killer left any

10:31.840 --> 10:32.910
traces,

10:32.910 --> 10:33.630
I think

10:34.000 --> 10:35.800
he will definitely notice them.

10:39.240 --> 10:40.030
How is it?

10:40.790 --> 10:42.320
The cause of death was not drowning.

10:42.320 --> 10:43.150
In his mouth and nose,

10:43.150 --> 10:44.350
there is no river mud.

10:44.510 --> 10:46.870
He obviously died
before he was thrown into the river.

10:46.870 --> 10:49.200
The fatal wound should be here.

10:49.320 --> 10:50.520
A ruptured windpipe.

10:52.240 --> 10:53.120
This wound...

10:53.390 --> 10:54.720
The edges are turned outward,

10:54.720 --> 10:56.640
so it wasn't caused by a sharp weapon.

10:56.640 --> 10:58.320
I've seen this kind of wound before.

10:58.320 --> 10:59.340
It should be...

11:00.080 --> 11:01.720
caused by a beast's bite.

11:01.720 --> 11:02.520
Could it be...

11:02.740 --> 11:04.910
that he was bitten to death
by wolves in the mountain?

11:04.910 --> 11:05.950
Normally,

11:06.390 --> 11:08.200
when wild beasts actively attack humans,

11:08.200 --> 11:09.840
it's always for food.

11:10.660 --> 11:12.850
But this body is so intact

11:13.120 --> 11:14.390
and hasn't been eaten.

11:14.830 --> 11:15.640
So,

11:16.670 --> 11:17.510
I think

11:18.410 --> 11:19.910
there must be something fishy about it.

11:19.910 --> 11:20.720
My Lord,

11:21.240 --> 11:22.270
nothing like this

11:22.320 --> 11:23.200
has ever happened

11:23.200 --> 11:24.400
in our county before.

11:24.520 --> 11:25.350
Could it be

11:25.790 --> 11:27.320
done by that green-haired demon?

11:27.320 --> 11:28.670
According to those who have seen it,

11:28.670 --> 11:30.510
that demon
has long fangs and a green face,

11:30.510 --> 11:32.430
with a bloody mouth like a wolf's.

11:32.460 --> 11:33.480
Nonsense.

11:34.320 --> 11:36.260
Handling cases requires solid evidence.

11:36.260 --> 11:37.120
Especially in front of

11:37.120 --> 11:38.450
the Divine Constables.

11:39.030 --> 11:39.840
Yes.

11:41.000 --> 11:42.320
Take the body to the county office first.

11:42.320 --> 11:43.510
It needs to be examined carefully.

11:43.510 --> 11:44.030
Right.

11:44.030 --> 11:44.670
Also,

11:44.670 --> 11:46.120
we must find out where the body
came from as soon as possible

11:46.120 --> 11:47.180
and confirm his identity.

11:47.180 --> 11:47.820
Yes.

11:47.840 --> 11:48.600
Take it away.

11:48.670 --> 11:49.440
Yes.

12:18.590 --> 12:20.720
This is the hinterland of Mount Fuyao,

12:20.910 --> 12:21.970
called Ghost Gate.

12:22.040 --> 12:23.050
Up there are some

12:23.200 --> 12:25.620
hanging coffins
that are over 1,000 years old.

12:25.620 --> 12:27.320
No wonder it's called Ghost Gate.

12:27.320 --> 12:28.120
Actually,

12:28.390 --> 12:29.510
it's not just because of

12:29.510 --> 12:31.120
these hanging coffins
that it got its name.

12:31.120 --> 12:33.480
It's really because
no one dares to come here.

12:33.480 --> 12:34.320
Lord Situ.

12:34.750 --> 12:35.620
Right now,

12:35.840 --> 12:38.080
the green-haired demon in Mingling
hasn't been eliminated.

12:38.080 --> 12:38.910
And it seems

12:39.720 --> 12:41.550
there's been a murder.

12:41.600 --> 12:43.400
I hope you can find out the truth.

12:44.840 --> 12:45.840
In this mountain,

12:46.320 --> 12:47.720
does anyone keep dogs?

12:50.920 --> 12:51.870
My Lord,

12:52.910 --> 12:54.790
some hunters used to keep them before.

12:54.790 --> 12:55.510
But in the past two years,

12:55.510 --> 12:56.640
we haven't seen any.

12:57.080 --> 12:58.080
Why?

12:58.480 --> 12:59.870
They were all taken by the Ji family

12:59.870 --> 13:01.390
and kept in the county town.

13:01.390 --> 13:02.670
Ji Ada loves dogs.

13:02.720 --> 13:03.910
Whenever he sees a good dog,

13:03.910 --> 13:05.270
he buys it.

13:06.120 --> 13:08.510
There are 2 prominent families
in Mingling.

13:08.510 --> 13:10.510
One is the Gong family,
a major shipping family,

13:10.510 --> 13:11.270
and the other

13:11.270 --> 13:13.080
is the Ji family, which runs rice shops.

13:13.080 --> 13:14.720
The Ji family supplies grain

13:14.870 --> 13:16.470
to all the surrounding counties.

13:16.470 --> 13:17.680
Their business is huge.

13:17.680 --> 13:18.760
The two Ji brothers,

13:18.760 --> 13:19.920
Ji Ada and Ji Er,

13:19.940 --> 13:21.320
have quite a background.

13:21.320 --> 13:23.270
The current Princess Ding

13:23.290 --> 13:24.740
is their cousin.

13:25.510 --> 13:26.510
I didn't expect

13:26.720 --> 13:28.270
this little Mingling

13:28.910 --> 13:31.120
to have so many big shots.

13:32.880 --> 13:33.940
Divine Constable,

13:34.270 --> 13:35.500
you suspect that the man

13:35.500 --> 13:37.030
was bitten to death by a dog?

13:37.600 --> 13:38.760
If someone really

13:38.790 --> 13:39.870
did it on purpose,

13:40.200 --> 13:41.390
then using a dog

13:41.500 --> 13:42.790
to hurt people

13:43.630 --> 13:45.000
is a possibility.

13:46.630 --> 13:47.440
However,

13:48.080 --> 13:49.350
all of this

13:49.600 --> 13:51.240
is just a guess for now.

13:51.910 --> 13:52.910
It reminds me of something.

13:52.910 --> 13:54.030
Speaking of dogs in the mountains,

13:54.030 --> 13:55.270
Ji Ada not only loves dogs,

13:55.270 --> 13:56.730
but he also likes hunting.

14:00.720 --> 14:01.510
It seems

14:01.530 --> 14:02.550
we need to pay a visit

14:02.550 --> 14:03.720
to this Ji Ada.

14:05.720 --> 14:07.270
We need to investigate Ji Ada

14:07.270 --> 14:09.270
and the green-haired demon.

14:10.750 --> 14:11.820
Lord Situ,

14:11.910 --> 14:13.650
the case report says

14:13.720 --> 14:14.870
that the green-haired demon

14:14.870 --> 14:17.000
likes to dig up graves and eat carrion.

14:18.440 --> 14:20.080
Where is that graveyard?

14:21.330 --> 14:23.050
At the northwest foot of Mount Fuyao,

14:23.050 --> 14:24.560
there is a mass grave.

14:24.710 --> 14:25.720
People have seen

14:25.720 --> 14:28.250
the green-haired demon there
more than once.

14:34.000 --> 14:35.130
Divine Constables,

14:35.240 --> 14:36.320
it's just ahead.

14:44.440 --> 14:45.240
Everyone.

14:46.550 --> 14:47.360
Meng Rui?

14:47.440 --> 14:48.240
Meng.

14:49.240 --> 14:50.030
Meng Rui?

14:50.270 --> 14:51.960
You managed to find this place?

14:51.960 --> 14:52.670
How was it?

14:53.150 --> 14:54.480
Any clues from searching the mountain?

14:54.480 --> 14:55.320
The traces have all been

14:55.320 --> 14:56.650
washed away by the rain.

14:56.840 --> 14:57.770
I found nothing.

15:04.870 --> 15:05.910
How about this?

15:06.720 --> 15:08.110
Zhenzhu, Yan,

15:08.550 --> 15:09.510
you go back

15:09.550 --> 15:11.080
and continue investigating the Ji family.

15:11.080 --> 15:12.080
Meng Rui and I

15:12.630 --> 15:13.440
will go

15:13.530 --> 15:16.060
look for clues
about the green-haired demon.

15:19.150 --> 15:20.120
Chiying bugs.

15:23.550 --> 15:24.360
Alright.

15:26.510 --> 15:27.320
Sanhuo,

15:27.670 --> 15:29.840
I'll leave Zhenzhu in your care.

15:30.510 --> 15:31.320
Don't worry.

15:32.470 --> 15:33.670
If you find any

15:33.670 --> 15:34.750
clues about the green-haired demon later,

15:34.750 --> 15:35.750
you must tell me.

15:36.960 --> 15:37.750
Don't worry.

15:38.320 --> 15:39.150
Be careful.

15:39.440 --> 15:40.570
Lord Situ, let's go.

15:44.670 --> 15:45.480
They must be hiding something from us.

15:45.480 --> 15:46.150
Let's go.

15:46.200 --> 15:47.000
Let's go.

16:09.240 --> 16:10.030
Huang Mazi,

16:10.050 --> 16:11.600
you fought dirty!

16:11.790 --> 16:13.080
Go! Get our men!

16:13.340 --> 16:13.910
Yes!

16:13.940 --> 16:15.200
Today, I'm going to fight the Ji family

16:15.200 --> 16:16.760
to the death!

16:16.960 --> 16:17.750
Wu Hai,

16:17.750 --> 16:18.870
I'm telling you!

16:18.870 --> 16:20.440
Even if a Gong comes here today,

16:20.440 --> 16:22.360
our Master can crush him

16:22.360 --> 16:23.750
with just one finger!

16:23.750 --> 16:24.550
Say that again!

16:24.550 --> 16:25.750
What?

16:25.920 --> 16:27.010
Say that again!

16:27.030 --> 16:28.360
What are you going to do about it?

16:28.360 --> 16:28.960
What are you going to do about it?

16:28.960 --> 16:30.510
-The Ji family and the Gong family are fighting again!
-What's the hurry?

16:30.510 --> 16:32.120
-It's not even your business.
-Someone almost died!

16:32.120 --> 16:33.280
Bro.

16:33.840 --> 16:35.110
Are you saying

16:35.150 --> 16:36.510
the Ji family that runs the rice shops

16:36.510 --> 16:37.860
is fighting the Gong family?

16:37.860 --> 16:39.220
What else could it be?

16:39.320 --> 16:40.390
I heard Ji Ada

16:40.440 --> 16:41.630
is going to duel Gong Sihai!

16:41.630 --> 16:42.750
Go and watch!

16:43.120 --> 16:45.180
-You'll miss it if you're late!
-Bye!

16:46.550 --> 16:47.510
Looks like

16:47.720 --> 16:49.770
there really can't be two tigers
on one mountain.

16:49.770 --> 16:51.840
I think it's just a small pond
with big egos.

16:51.840 --> 16:53.150
He'll be here soon! Just you wait!

16:53.150 --> 16:53.790
Just you wait!

16:53.790 --> 16:55.200
I'll beat you to death today!

16:55.200 --> 16:56.270
I'm telling you!

16:56.270 --> 16:57.240
Don't you even know

16:57.240 --> 16:58.240
who our Master is?

16:58.240 --> 16:59.750
Messing with the Ji family

16:59.750 --> 17:01.960
means messing with
the Great Shi royal family!

17:01.960 --> 17:03.440
It means messing with the one

17:03.440 --> 17:04.160
on the throne!

17:04.160 --> 17:04.880
Exactly!

17:04.880 --> 17:05.349
Yeah!

17:05.349 --> 17:07.480
That's between the Gong and Ji families!

17:07.480 --> 17:08.839
Who do you think you are?

17:09.069 --> 17:10.030
No matter how loud you bark,

17:10.030 --> 17:12.480
you're just a dog of the Ji family!

17:12.550 --> 17:13.480
That's right, a dog!

17:13.480 --> 17:14.510
Say that again!

17:14.510 --> 17:15.160
A dog!

17:15.310 --> 17:16.270
Say it again!

17:16.270 --> 17:17.349
Dog! Dog! Dog!

17:17.349 --> 17:18.589
-I'll kill you!
-Dog!

17:18.640 --> 17:19.900
What's all this noise?

17:20.310 --> 17:21.339
Master Ji is here.

17:22.190 --> 17:23.130
Master!

17:23.240 --> 17:24.319
You're finally here!

17:24.319 --> 17:25.619
Look what he did to me!

17:25.640 --> 17:27.130
Stand up for me, Master!

17:27.160 --> 17:28.510
Why are you fighting?

17:28.510 --> 17:29.550
Just you wait!

17:33.570 --> 17:37.300
[Ji Ada, Owner of Ji's Rice Shop]

17:33.920 --> 17:36.510
A few people getting hurt or killed
is no big deal,

17:36.510 --> 17:37.440
but what about

17:37.850 --> 17:39.660
your Master Gong's

17:39.750 --> 17:40.830
reputation?

17:41.550 --> 17:42.350
Mr. Ji,

17:43.030 --> 17:44.070
stop being

17:44.070 --> 17:45.270
so sarcastic here!

17:45.750 --> 17:46.720
You were the ones

17:46.720 --> 17:48.310
who broke the rules on the dock first.

17:48.310 --> 17:49.720
How could you

17:49.880 --> 17:51.400
keep delaying payment

17:51.440 --> 17:52.960
for using our ships?

17:52.960 --> 17:53.750
You should see

17:53.750 --> 17:54.640
how much rice you confiscated from us!

17:54.640 --> 17:56.160
A debt must be repaid.

17:56.240 --> 17:58.030
That's only fair.

17:58.270 --> 17:59.350
Besides,

17:59.440 --> 18:01.030
it's just a few bags of rice.

18:01.160 --> 18:02.070
Did you really

18:02.090 --> 18:03.470
have to go this far?

18:04.310 --> 18:06.710
Is your Ji family that desperate
for money?

18:09.960 --> 18:12.240
As far as I, Ji Ada, am concerned,

18:12.550 --> 18:14.490
it's a huge deal.

18:14.520 --> 18:16.530
Let alone a few bags of rice,

18:16.720 --> 18:18.250
even if it's a single grain,

18:18.720 --> 18:20.920
none of you will get

18:21.160 --> 18:23.050
to eat it without my permission.

18:24.640 --> 18:26.160
We've shown your Gong family some respect

18:26.160 --> 18:27.380
in the past,

18:27.830 --> 18:30.160
but you just don't know
how to appreciate it.

18:30.160 --> 18:32.550
The Gong flag only flies on the sea,

18:33.160 --> 18:34.920
but once you come ashore,

18:35.440 --> 18:37.420
the land

18:37.440 --> 18:39.400
belongs to the Ji family.

18:39.440 --> 18:40.640
This Ji Ada

18:40.960 --> 18:43.490
really throws his weight around
just because

18:43.510 --> 18:45.030
he's related to the royal family.

18:45.030 --> 18:46.000
Do you few really think

18:46.000 --> 18:46.510
you're in a position

18:46.510 --> 18:47.910
to challenge our master?

18:47.960 --> 18:49.240
Go get that Gong here

18:49.240 --> 18:50.030
now!

18:50.030 --> 18:52.690
If you've got the guts,
wait till my men get here!

19:03.010 --> 19:04.790
[Brocade and Silks]

19:09.350 --> 19:10.480
Black Silk Leopard!

19:11.030 --> 19:11.920
Is this a dog?

19:11.920 --> 19:12.680
It's a bear!

19:16.750 --> 19:18.750
They say it once bit through a man's neck,

19:18.750 --> 19:19.920
and that's how it got the nickname

19:19.920 --> 19:20.980
"Throatbreaker."

19:21.440 --> 19:23.900
-Look at how vicious it is.
-Throatbreaker?

19:24.240 --> 19:25.350
Our master said

19:25.750 --> 19:27.550
not to bother him over every little thing

19:27.550 --> 19:28.700
at the dock.

19:29.070 --> 19:30.310
Just bring Black Silk Leopard over

19:30.310 --> 19:31.110
to take a look.

19:36.980 --> 19:37.900
Just now,

19:38.070 --> 19:39.730
who was causing trouble here?

19:39.750 --> 19:40.550
Mr. Ji.

19:41.370 --> 19:42.770
Say something, will you?

19:43.880 --> 19:45.350
Black Silk Leopard.

19:46.440 --> 19:47.640
What a fine dog.

19:48.190 --> 19:50.210
Go back and tell Gong Sihai

19:50.750 --> 19:52.880
I really like this Black Silk Leopard.

19:53.350 --> 19:54.750
Tell him to name his price.

19:54.750 --> 19:55.970
Whatever it costs,

19:56.000 --> 19:57.180
I'll pay double.

19:57.210 --> 19:59.210
That's a deal you can't lose, right?

20:00.920 --> 20:02.920
Having a chance to do me a favor

20:03.310 --> 20:05.390
is a blessing for the Gong family.

20:05.420 --> 20:06.920
Ji Ada, what are you talking about?

20:06.920 --> 20:08.680
Don't push it too far!

20:11.720 --> 20:12.510
Move!

20:20.640 --> 20:21.440
Guards!

20:27.490 --> 20:28.290
Master!

20:28.310 --> 20:29.550
Master, are you alright?

20:29.550 --> 20:30.950
-Let's go!
-Let's go now!

20:31.030 --> 20:32.070
Let's go now!

20:32.090 --> 20:32.900
Let's go!

20:38.880 --> 20:39.510
Are you alright?

20:39.510 --> 20:39.920
I'm fine.

20:39.920 --> 20:41.830
So it's the two Divine Constables.

20:41.830 --> 20:42.960
We meet again.

20:43.310 --> 20:45.550
If you hadn't intervened just now,

20:45.640 --> 20:47.370
it would have been a disaster.

20:47.390 --> 20:49.310
So you knew it would cause trouble?

20:49.310 --> 20:50.680
Then why did you bring this beast out

20:50.680 --> 20:51.640
to show off?

20:51.960 --> 20:53.960
Weren't you afraid it would hurt someone?

20:53.960 --> 20:54.960
I absolutely

20:55.550 --> 20:57.510
cannot agree with you, My Lord.

20:57.830 --> 21:00.030
Although Black Silk Leopard is fierce,

21:00.160 --> 21:01.550
it is extremely smart

21:01.640 --> 21:03.770
and would never bite people randomly.

21:04.160 --> 21:05.830
As you saw just now,

21:05.850 --> 21:07.090
if Ji Ada hadn't

21:07.120 --> 21:08.680
provoked our Gong family first,

21:08.680 --> 21:10.550
how could Black Silk Leopard, eager to

21:10.550 --> 21:12.350
protect its master,
have attacked on its own?

21:12.350 --> 21:13.310
Right, My Lord?

21:14.350 --> 21:15.400
So Black Silk Leopard

21:15.400 --> 21:16.720
is indeed a good dog.

21:17.160 --> 21:19.160
Does it just bite through the throat

21:19.160 --> 21:20.750
of whoever its master tells it to?

21:20.750 --> 21:21.550
My Lady,

21:21.680 --> 21:23.830
you can't joke about this.

21:23.980 --> 21:25.350
Throatbreaker?

21:25.350 --> 21:27.160
It's just a baseless rumor.

21:27.270 --> 21:28.480
It never happened.

21:30.880 --> 21:31.960
Today, a corpse

21:31.980 --> 21:34.180
was found in the Yan River.

21:34.550 --> 21:35.550
Mr. Reda,

21:35.750 --> 21:37.070
please go back to your residence

21:37.070 --> 21:38.240
and tell Master Gong Sihai

21:38.240 --> 21:39.510
that the Divine Constable Bureau
invites him

21:39.510 --> 21:41.840
to the county office to identify the body.

21:49.130 --> 21:54.020
[Identifying the Bones,
Finding a Mother for an Orphaned Girl]

22:52.480 --> 22:53.880
The green-haired demon?

22:54.200 --> 22:55.000
Meng Rui,

22:55.310 --> 22:56.110
watch out.

23:05.470 --> 23:06.370
Chiying bugs!

23:16.000 --> 23:17.190
It's a kid.

23:19.830 --> 23:20.840
Chiying bugs.

23:22.410 --> 23:23.170
Don't move!

23:24.030 --> 23:25.050
It seems

23:25.790 --> 23:27.590
it's exactly as Old Geezer said.

23:38.200 --> 23:39.330
They are fireflies.

23:43.080 --> 23:44.030
You brat,

23:45.170 --> 23:46.690
you're quite smart.

23:46.720 --> 23:48.270
You know how to use fireflies for light

23:48.270 --> 23:49.510
when looking for things.

23:49.510 --> 23:50.310
I guess

23:51.510 --> 23:53.240
you're the green-haired demon

23:53.560 --> 23:55.560
they've been talking about, right?

23:59.750 --> 24:00.660
Why were you

24:01.240 --> 24:03.040
digging up those bones just now?

24:03.640 --> 24:04.720
What were you looking for?

24:04.720 --> 24:05.830
What's your name?

24:06.310 --> 24:07.120
Xia...

24:08.140 --> 24:11.460
[Xia Jiuying]

24:08.340 --> 24:09.240
Jiu...

24:11.400 --> 24:12.200
Ying!

24:20.720 --> 24:21.740
Fellow villagers,

24:21.740 --> 24:23.030
don't panic.

24:24.270 --> 24:25.240
Please step forward

24:25.090 --> 24:27.150
[Mingling County Government]

24:25.240 --> 24:27.440
and identify the deceased's clothing.

24:27.720 --> 24:29.980
Anyone who recognizes this person

24:30.240 --> 24:31.880
or can provide any clues

24:32.510 --> 24:34.910
will be rewarded by the county government.

24:40.890 --> 24:44.600
[Gong Sihai, Owner of Gong's Shipping]

24:46.910 --> 24:49.890
[Mingling County Government]

24:50.480 --> 24:52.110
I'm Gong Sihai. I'm sorry

24:52.130 --> 24:53.970
for being late.

24:54.070 --> 24:55.350
This is the head of the Gong family,

24:55.350 --> 24:56.160
Gong Sihai,

24:56.270 --> 24:58.010
known as Fourth Master Gong.

24:58.400 --> 24:59.510
This is Lady Constable Frost,

24:59.510 --> 25:00.920
and this is Lord Constable Iron.

25:00.920 --> 25:02.270
Greetings, Lady Constable Frost,

25:02.270 --> 25:03.470
Lord Constable Iron.

25:06.310 --> 25:07.440
Fourth Master Gong.

25:08.110 --> 25:09.920
Please take a close look.

25:10.070 --> 25:11.720
Do you know this person?

25:24.310 --> 25:25.240
No.

25:28.510 --> 25:30.800
The corpse is mutilated
beyond recognition.

25:30.800 --> 25:31.930
Fourth Master Gong,

25:32.310 --> 25:34.640
how can you tell you don't recognize him?

25:35.000 --> 25:36.880
It's exactly because I couldn't tell

25:36.880 --> 25:38.720
that I said I don't recognize him.

25:38.720 --> 25:40.030
If it is someone familiar,

25:40.030 --> 25:40.960
even if mutilated beyond recognition,

25:40.960 --> 25:42.690
you will still recognize them.

25:43.200 --> 25:44.440
Lady Constable Frost,

25:44.440 --> 25:46.040
you are implying something.

25:47.720 --> 25:49.590
If I'm guessing correctly,

25:49.640 --> 25:50.440
this person

25:50.590 --> 25:52.200
was bitten to death, right?

25:52.220 --> 25:53.280
When Reda came back

25:53.480 --> 25:54.880
from the dock today

25:55.240 --> 25:56.400
and told me you two

25:56.880 --> 25:58.310
had invited me to identify a body,

25:58.310 --> 25:59.310
I figured

25:59.480 --> 26:00.720
that because of

26:01.030 --> 26:02.960
Black Silk Leopard's appearance,

26:03.240 --> 26:04.640
you two had probably already considered me

26:04.640 --> 26:06.000
a suspect.

26:06.070 --> 26:08.680
It's about a human life.
How can we afford to overlook anything?

26:08.680 --> 26:10.310
The case hasn't been solved yet.

26:10.310 --> 26:11.830
Until we catch the real killer,

26:11.830 --> 26:13.310
anyone could be a suspect.

26:13.310 --> 26:14.510
Then let me say a word

26:14.510 --> 26:15.510
in my own defense.

26:15.830 --> 26:16.880
I keep Black Silk Leopard

26:16.880 --> 26:18.880
as a guard dog.

26:18.880 --> 26:21.080
I rarely even take it out of the mansion.

26:21.720 --> 26:23.310
And I would never

26:23.310 --> 26:24.440
let it hurt anyone.

26:25.790 --> 26:27.440
As for what happened at the dock today,

26:27.440 --> 26:29.030
as you could see,

26:29.440 --> 26:31.110
it was purely an accident.

26:35.830 --> 26:37.590
Fourth Master Gong, don't get worked up.

26:37.590 --> 26:39.110
We never said it was you.

26:39.720 --> 26:40.440
Since you don't recognize him,

26:40.440 --> 26:41.970
then there's nothing else.

26:42.400 --> 26:43.270
You may leave.

26:45.790 --> 26:47.110
Then I will take my leave.

26:47.110 --> 26:47.920
Please.

26:51.240 --> 26:52.480
People from Tianhuang City are here.

26:52.480 --> 26:53.400
Things are unsettled right now.

26:53.400 --> 26:54.880
Find the Young Master
and bring him back at once.

26:54.880 --> 26:55.640
Yes.

26:58.010 --> 27:03.570
[Mingling County Government]

27:03.110 --> 27:04.000
Lord Situ,

27:04.000 --> 27:05.400
please have the body taken to the morgue

27:05.400 --> 27:06.110
and kept under guard.

27:06.110 --> 27:07.480
I need to continue the autopsy.

27:07.480 --> 27:08.310
Alright.

27:08.680 --> 27:09.440
Lai.

27:09.440 --> 27:10.110
Yes.

27:10.350 --> 27:11.160
Lift it.

27:10.910 --> 27:13.930
[Mingling County Government]

27:15.710 --> 27:16.590
Everyone, disperse.

27:16.590 --> 27:17.790
Stop gathering here.

27:22.830 --> 27:24.070
You noticed him too?

27:24.210 --> 27:25.880
He stood at the very back of the crowd,

27:25.880 --> 27:27.680
but he couldn't stop looking in.

27:27.680 --> 27:29.270
Even when he left, his pace

27:29.270 --> 27:31.130
was faster than everyone else's.

27:31.480 --> 27:33.110
He must know the deceased.

27:33.720 --> 27:34.480
Did you notice

27:34.480 --> 27:36.110
his ears just now?

27:36.790 --> 27:37.590
Cauliflower ears?

27:37.590 --> 27:38.310
Exactly.

27:38.310 --> 27:39.640
They are exactly the same as those
of the corpse from the Yan River.

27:39.640 --> 27:41.310
I'm very familiar with ears like these.

27:41.310 --> 27:41.920
You don't get ears like these

27:41.920 --> 27:43.790
unless you've trained in wrestling

27:43.790 --> 27:45.640
for 10 or 20 years.

27:46.400 --> 27:47.320
So,

27:47.400 --> 27:48.720
the victim must have been skilled

27:48.720 --> 27:49.830
in wrestling too.

27:49.720 --> 27:52.950
[Mingling County Government]

27:50.480 --> 27:51.510
There must be some connection

27:51.510 --> 27:52.880
between the two of them.

27:53.830 --> 27:54.640
Try this.

27:57.310 --> 27:58.110
Eat up.

27:58.170 --> 27:59.070
Don't pick up dirty things

27:59.070 --> 28:00.800
from the ground to eat anymore.

28:03.640 --> 28:04.440
Xia Jiuying.

28:04.480 --> 28:05.310
I was asking

28:05.340 --> 28:06.660
where you live.

28:06.830 --> 28:07.880
But you brought me

28:07.880 --> 28:09.270
to Ji's Rice Shop.

28:09.310 --> 28:10.770
Are you from the Ji family?

28:12.920 --> 28:13.980
Then let me ask you.

28:14.640 --> 28:16.240
Does the Ji family keep dogs?

28:22.110 --> 28:23.640
Do they or not?

28:29.510 --> 28:30.530
This child.

28:30.680 --> 28:31.740
I've asked around.

28:32.470 --> 28:33.440
The people around here

28:33.440 --> 28:34.590
all know this child.

28:34.590 --> 28:35.960
They say she's a servant of the Ji family.

28:35.960 --> 28:37.240
She is a girl.

28:37.720 --> 28:39.120
With her hair a mess,

28:39.400 --> 28:41.400
the way she's wolfing down her food,

28:41.400 --> 28:42.860
and her tattered clothes,

28:44.030 --> 28:45.270
it's obvious she's been poorly treated

28:45.270 --> 28:46.720
at Ji Mansion.

28:50.590 --> 28:51.400
Meng Rui.

28:53.230 --> 28:55.030
Look at the scar on her neck.

28:55.420 --> 28:57.110
Doesn't it look like it was caused

28:57.110 --> 28:57.920
by a dog chain?

28:59.200 --> 29:00.030
I'm full.

29:00.060 --> 29:00.500
I'm leaving.

29:00.500 --> 29:01.230
Xia Jiuying!

29:03.060 --> 29:03.950
Stand still.

29:04.640 --> 29:05.480
Listen to me.

29:05.560 --> 29:07.770
Although you are a servant of Ji Mansion,

29:07.770 --> 29:08.940
if in the future

29:09.480 --> 29:10.750
Ji Ada treats you badly,

29:10.750 --> 29:11.550
or

29:11.780 --> 29:12.980
if he dares to hit you,

29:14.070 --> 29:15.470
you don't have to go back.

29:16.830 --> 29:17.640
No!

29:18.510 --> 29:19.590
I want to go back!

29:25.680 --> 29:26.770
This child.

29:27.150 --> 29:28.340
[Rice Shop]

29:30.270 --> 29:31.310
You've been watching

29:31.310 --> 29:33.070
this rice shop since earlier.

29:33.240 --> 29:34.440
Any clues?

29:35.270 --> 29:36.480
Since we got here,

29:36.920 --> 29:38.070
a total of 27 people

29:38.070 --> 29:39.590
have gone into the rice shop,

29:39.590 --> 29:40.790
but only five or six

29:41.070 --> 29:42.400
have come out.

29:42.100 --> 29:43.920
[Rice Shop]

29:42.720 --> 29:44.190
Whether they bought rice or not,

29:44.190 --> 29:45.590
[Rice Shop]

29:44.510 --> 29:45.710
they have to come out.

29:46.400 --> 29:48.110
Where did the remaining

29:49.010 --> 29:50.050
20 or so people go?

29:50.240 --> 29:52.340
They couldn't have just vanished
into thin air.

29:52.340 --> 29:53.360
So,

29:54.640 --> 29:55.880
in this rice shop,

29:56.310 --> 29:58.000
there must be a hidden secret.

29:58.790 --> 30:00.110
Then let's go and see

30:00.440 --> 30:01.480
the quality

30:01.480 --> 30:02.810
of the Ji family's rice.

30:04.110 --> 30:06.070
Before we go, we...

30:07.880 --> 30:09.310
need to dress up.

30:09.880 --> 30:12.080
Gold rice, silver rice, and pearl rice.

30:12.240 --> 30:14.640
They say in the Ji family's rice bags,

30:14.640 --> 30:16.100
there are rare treasures.

30:16.110 --> 30:16.920
Today,

30:17.830 --> 30:18.880
I'd like to

30:19.110 --> 30:20.880
broaden my horizons here.

30:21.480 --> 30:22.310
Rui,

30:22.880 --> 30:24.480
go get the manager.

30:24.640 --> 30:25.790
I...

30:26.000 --> 30:28.260
am going to
spend a lot of money here today

30:29.070 --> 30:30.730
and play for some real stakes.

30:31.110 --> 30:31.920
Manager.

30:33.310 --> 30:34.110
Coming!

30:35.680 --> 30:36.640
Gentlemen,

30:36.720 --> 30:38.110
what would you like to buy?

30:38.110 --> 30:39.240
That depends on

30:40.030 --> 30:41.790
what you sell here.

30:41.650 --> 30:46.610
[Grain]

30:42.590 --> 30:43.880
You must be joking.

30:43.880 --> 30:45.110
This is a rice shop,

30:45.110 --> 30:47.110
so naturally we sell rice and grain.

30:47.590 --> 30:48.590
Rice sounds fine.

30:48.680 --> 30:50.310
There is an ancient saying
about a golden millet dream.

30:50.310 --> 30:51.110
Today,

30:51.880 --> 30:52.880
I want to

30:52.880 --> 30:54.940
live it up and forget myself for once.

30:57.440 --> 30:58.590
I want to buy that.

31:00.070 --> 31:02.270
What are you talking about?

31:03.510 --> 31:04.790
That.

31:13.480 --> 31:14.740
To be honest, Manager,

31:14.880 --> 31:15.880
Rui and I

31:15.880 --> 31:18.270
came here especially

31:18.500 --> 31:20.100
because of your reputation.

31:22.750 --> 31:24.270
Oh, that?

31:24.480 --> 31:25.270
Sir,

31:25.310 --> 31:27.380
you've come to the right place.

31:28.070 --> 31:29.070
Please follow me.

31:30.030 --> 31:30.830
Please.

31:31.310 --> 31:33.000
Let's go, Rui.

31:34.510 --> 31:35.110
Please.

31:35.110 --> 31:35.680
We clearly saw him

31:35.680 --> 31:36.880
come this way.

31:38.310 --> 31:39.680
Yan, Miss Bai?

31:40.680 --> 31:42.830
Are you two here to spend

31:42.880 --> 31:44.080
some money today too?

31:46.560 --> 31:47.900
[Grain]

31:50.880 --> 31:51.590
We heard

31:51.590 --> 31:52.830
you were here,

31:52.850 --> 31:53.610
so we thought

31:53.640 --> 31:54.680
we'd come and join the fun.

31:54.680 --> 31:55.510
Right, right.

31:55.530 --> 31:57.190
I'm just following my sister.

31:57.510 --> 31:58.830
You came at the right time.

31:58.830 --> 31:59.640
Today,

31:59.920 --> 32:01.310
all expenses

32:01.510 --> 32:03.030
are on me.

32:06.910 --> 32:07.710
Everyone,

32:08.070 --> 32:09.200
please come inside.

32:15.040 --> 32:16.080
I didn't expect

32:16.110 --> 32:17.240
there to be a whole other world

32:17.240 --> 32:18.500
behind this rice shop.

32:20.680 --> 32:21.510
It finally feels like

32:21.510 --> 32:23.200
a major case.

32:23.200 --> 32:25.310
Come on, place your bets! One hundred!

32:25.310 --> 32:26.640
Bets are final!

32:38.400 --> 32:39.200
Looks like

32:39.950 --> 32:41.950
this is an underground boxing ring.

32:42.070 --> 32:44.270
Let's split up and see

32:44.510 --> 32:46.910
if there are any other illegal activities.

33:05.110 --> 33:06.240
Hit him!

33:11.110 --> 33:11.880
Come on!

33:14.880 --> 33:17.030
-Bravo!
-Hit him!

33:17.030 --> 33:18.270
Hurry! Hurry!

33:18.270 --> 33:19.070
That's the guy

33:19.070 --> 33:20.070
Zhenzhu and I followed

33:20.070 --> 33:21.000
from the county office.

33:21.000 --> 33:23.480
Looks like the victim
in the Yan River corpse case

33:23.480 --> 33:25.880
used to fight underground boxing here too.

33:48.400 --> 33:49.270
Harder!

33:49.270 --> 33:50.550
Go!

33:54.880 --> 33:56.100
I want my mother!

33:56.240 --> 33:58.370
-I want my mother!
-Jiuying! Jiuying.

33:58.640 --> 33:59.880
It's me, Gong Le.

34:02.240 --> 34:04.870
[Gong Le, Young Master of the Gong Family]

34:04.890 --> 34:05.760
Who is it?

34:06.090 --> 34:07.650
Who's teasing the dog here?

34:08.719 --> 34:10.000
Huang Mazi is coming!

34:11.400 --> 34:13.219
Who is it? Who's back there?

34:25.090 --> 34:26.040
Come on, Jiuying.

34:26.040 --> 34:27.920
-I'm not going!
-Come on.

34:29.480 --> 34:30.280
Be a good girl.

34:35.150 --> 34:35.960
Let's go.

34:37.880 --> 34:38.670
Let's go.

34:44.070 --> 34:44.880
Beat him!

34:44.880 --> 34:45.780
Go!

34:50.840 --> 34:52.130
Not eating?

34:52.670 --> 34:53.590
You're too spoiled.

34:53.590 --> 34:54.230
Master!

34:54.710 --> 34:55.510
Master!

34:55.880 --> 34:56.590
Come on!

34:57.230 --> 34:59.360
This... This girl came back on her own?

35:01.070 --> 35:02.440
Don't bother me here.

35:03.480 --> 35:04.230
Drag her away.

35:04.230 --> 35:06.690
Give her a whipping
and starve her for 3 days.

35:06.960 --> 35:08.220
If she runs away again,

35:08.400 --> 35:09.600
break one of her legs.

35:10.880 --> 35:12.140
I dare you to run again!

35:15.800 --> 35:16.590
Master.

35:17.630 --> 35:19.300
Are you still worrying about

35:19.330 --> 35:21.300
Black Silk Leopard?

35:21.440 --> 35:23.380
I've been having bad luck lately.

35:23.440 --> 35:24.760
Bad things

35:26.880 --> 35:28.960
keep happening one after another.

35:37.800 --> 35:40.150
-Bravo!
-We won!

35:56.670 --> 35:57.630
We won!

36:00.030 --> 36:01.050
One more round!

36:03.150 --> 36:03.890
How is it?

36:08.030 --> 36:08.920
You piece of trash!

36:08.920 --> 36:09.960
Look at you!

36:09.960 --> 36:11.220
You made me lose money!

36:28.710 --> 36:29.510
Rice paste?

36:29.880 --> 36:31.070
Cloth strips dipped in rice paste

36:31.070 --> 36:31.880
become extremely hard

36:31.880 --> 36:33.150
once they dry.

36:33.590 --> 36:35.960
Wrapping them around your hands
protects them

36:35.960 --> 36:38.360
and makes your punches much more powerful.

36:39.070 --> 36:40.190
I see.

36:40.230 --> 36:41.150
Alright, he won!

36:41.150 --> 36:42.850
Will you keep your promise?

36:42.880 --> 36:43.670
Zhe Shan!

36:43.670 --> 36:45.130
Call Zhe Shan out to fight!

36:45.510 --> 36:46.510
Where is Zhe Shan?

36:46.880 --> 36:47.960
Have you found him?

36:48.880 --> 36:50.030
Not yet.

36:50.190 --> 36:51.000
Master.

36:51.080 --> 36:52.680
Right now, among our boxers,

36:52.840 --> 36:53.880
besides Zhe Shan,

36:53.960 --> 36:55.220
only Tiesha is decent.

36:55.230 --> 36:56.090
As for the rest,

36:56.230 --> 36:58.440
there are really few who can really fight.

36:58.440 --> 36:59.490
The matches in the arena

36:59.490 --> 37:01.280
are getting less and less interesting.

37:01.280 --> 37:02.230
In the future,

37:02.400 --> 37:04.480
I'm afraid fewer people will place bets.

37:04.480 --> 37:06.190
Gamblers may love to gamble,

37:06.360 --> 37:07.690
but they're not stupid.

37:08.590 --> 37:10.280
If there are no new tricks,

37:10.760 --> 37:11.640
taking all

37:11.670 --> 37:13.280
their money

37:13.280 --> 37:14.670
won't be that simple.

37:15.230 --> 37:16.030
Where is Zhe Shan?

37:16.030 --> 37:16.880
Bro,

37:16.960 --> 37:18.670
who is this Zhe Shan you're talking about?

37:18.670 --> 37:19.880
You don't even know him?

37:19.880 --> 37:21.670
He is the Ji family's top boxer.

37:21.670 --> 37:22.760
He is ruthless,

37:22.760 --> 37:24.220
winning 9 out of 10 fights.

37:24.320 --> 37:25.110
This Zhe Shan

37:25.130 --> 37:26.400
hasn't come out for a long time, right?

37:26.400 --> 37:27.360
Exactly.

37:27.360 --> 37:28.070
He made me

37:28.070 --> 37:30.130
lose money for half a month straight.

37:30.630 --> 37:31.590
Tell Zhe Shan to come out!

37:31.590 --> 37:32.340
Zhe Shan!

37:32.920 --> 37:33.590
Come out!

37:34.000 --> 37:34.880
In my opinion,

37:34.880 --> 37:36.880
that corpse is most likely Zhe Shan.

37:37.630 --> 37:38.440
Do you think

37:38.480 --> 37:39.630
it's possible

37:40.000 --> 37:41.320
that Zhe Shan was bitten to death

37:41.320 --> 37:42.580
by the Ji family's dog?

37:44.190 --> 37:45.720
The Ji family keeps dogs,

37:45.840 --> 37:47.000
but they wouldn't let them hurt people,

37:47.000 --> 37:47.840
let alone kill

37:47.840 --> 37:49.070
their own boxer.

37:49.280 --> 37:50.400
I don't think so.

38:00.590 --> 38:02.670
How come I forgot you?

38:03.110 --> 38:04.010
Shui!

38:04.360 --> 38:05.960
Send Xia Jiuying to the ring!

38:07.920 --> 38:08.710
Master,

38:08.960 --> 38:10.250
can this girl do it?

38:10.920 --> 38:12.110
Don't forget,

38:12.110 --> 38:13.320
she fought wild dogs for food

38:13.320 --> 38:14.920
at the age of seven,

38:15.190 --> 38:16.360
and at nine, she could kill

38:16.360 --> 38:17.800
an alpha wolf.

38:18.190 --> 38:19.760
Winning or losing doesn't matter.

38:19.760 --> 38:21.010
What matters is...

38:21.960 --> 38:24.360
putting on a good show
for the people down there.

38:24.360 --> 38:25.340
Otherwise,

38:26.150 --> 38:27.450
they'll think

38:27.590 --> 38:30.110
there's no one left in the Ji family.

38:32.750 --> 38:33.590
Yes.

38:35.320 --> 38:36.110
Come on.

38:36.760 --> 38:37.590
Go!

38:45.760 --> 38:46.590
Go!

39:03.400 --> 39:04.560
Xia Jiuying?

39:05.030 --> 39:05.840
Who?

39:06.440 --> 39:07.150
Meng Rui and I met her

39:07.150 --> 39:08.760
in the Corpse Forest Graveyard.

39:08.760 --> 39:10.760
The green-haired demon Situ Bo mentioned

39:10.760 --> 39:11.800
must be her.

39:15.400 --> 39:16.760
Let's go take a look.

39:19.190 --> 39:20.000
Who is she?

39:22.910 --> 39:24.260
I'm asking you!

39:24.400 --> 39:25.590
Are you kidding me?

39:25.670 --> 39:27.530
Having this little brat fight me?

39:31.100 --> 39:32.360
Teach her a good lesson!

39:32.360 --> 39:33.000
Will you fight or not?

39:33.000 --> 39:33.680
Yeah!

39:36.190 --> 39:37.040
Fight!

39:38.710 --> 39:40.070
Beat her to death!

39:47.220 --> 39:48.510
[Small]

39:47.920 --> 39:49.590
Come on, place your bets!

39:48.530 --> 39:49.820
[Xia Jiuying]

39:49.590 --> 39:51.760
Xia Jiuying or Tiesha?

39:52.480 --> 39:54.360
Bets are final! Bets are final!

39:54.400 --> 39:56.190
Come on, hurry up!

39:56.360 --> 39:57.670
Bets are final!

39:57.830 --> 39:59.250
[Xia Jiuying]

39:58.280 --> 39:58.800
Tiesha!

40:01.440 --> 40:02.070
Bet on Tiesha!

40:02.070 --> 40:03.540
Hurry up and pay!

40:03.710 --> 40:04.830
Wolf cub,

40:05.760 --> 40:06.800
whether I can

40:06.800 --> 40:08.260
win big this time

40:08.960 --> 40:10.070
depends on you.
